sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor A as Author
    participant P as Panel
    participant Q as Queue
    A->>+P: Publish
    P->>Q: Render preview
    loop Every 5 s
        P->>Q: Status?
    end
    alt Rendered
        Q-->>P: Done
        P-->>A: Published
    else Failed
        Q-->>P: Error
        P-->>-A: Try again later
    end
